# GMS's third here is Teleport Mastery, which this game has no notion of, so
# the page goes to the magician's opening swing instead -- the only attack in
# the line still unclaimed, at the better rate a first-job skill needs to be
# worth a node. The same trade the I/L's Ice Strike node makes.
#
# Poison Mist's fog is a burn the swing leaves, and every lever this hands the
# swing rides into it.
